---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 119",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-21",
  "dateModified": "2026-08-21",
  "description": "Day 119. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-08-21 | Day 119" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 119. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-08-21">2026-08-21</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 119</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 119</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 119. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 119.</p>
      <h3>▎495亿：阿里AI的收入爆发</h3>
      <h3>▎数亿美元：Meta给微软交"AI税"</h3>
      <h3>▎平头哥：国产芯片的"替代"信号</h3>
      <h3>▎6MB：Vercel的fx和"轻量化"趋势</h3>
      <h3>▎触觉：让世界模型"摸得着"</h3>
      <h3>▎三个切面，一个结论</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 119天，周五...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这三个数字分别代表AI的三个切面——大的在赚钱，中的在花钱，小的在变轻...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 阿里巴巴最新财报显示，AI相关产品年化收入突破495亿元人民币，折合73亿美元，在阿里云外部商业化收入中占比升至35%...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 从73亿到100亿美元，一个季度增长37%...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 更值得关注的是吴泳铭说的另一句话：AI算力投资回报确定性高，Capex投入三年内回本...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 三年回本...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 495亿是什么概念？阿里云做了这么多年，AI收入现在占到外部商业化收入的三分之一以上...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 我想起去年这时候，行业里还在讨论"AI能不能赚钱"...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 据彭博社报道，Meta正通过微软Azure云服务采购AI服务，年支出高达数亿美元，已成为微软规模最大的AI客户之一...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这条新闻有意思在哪？Meta自己有AI能力，有Llama，有研究团队，但它还是选择花钱买微软的算力...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 119. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-08-21/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
